   <media:description>This asana is part of the 4th series of ashtanga yoga. The preparation of hip opening starts from the 1st, 2nd and the 3rd series. Taking help of the belt when you are attempting it for the first time can provide help to bind the hands. Please be careful and do it only if it’s comfortable for your knee and hips. 

If you wish to learn this practice, we offer online ashtanga yoga classes where we teach this method systematically to help you develop a discipline of daily practising. Please check our website for details. 

Happy practising :)</media:description>
